dynamic stability of blunt entry vehicles. The models to be tested include variations of geometries. Forced oscillation testing and free flight testing will provide static and dynamic stability data for the geometries tested as well as free flight dynamics which will serve as validation data for trajectory simulation analysis.\n Responsibilities \n Develop models in in the form of .igs or .stp, as well as the native CAD format used for the design work\n Develop CAD models for oscillation configurations that include location of mounting interface at specified reference points,\n Design geometry to accommodate thermal inset fasteners for accurate and reliable mounting to the balance sting\n Create CAD solid models of free flight wind tunnel models using FDM 3D printing methods or similar.\n Design the models to enable a movable center of gravity\n Requirements \n Undergraduate or Graduate student with a degree in mechanical or aerospace engineering\n Minimum of 2 years’ experience in developing CAD models or 2 semesters of relevant CAD course","status":"open","score_parts":{"field":35.0,"location":20.0,"freshness":15.0,"openness":10.0,"source":5.0},"insights":{"skills":[{"name":"CAD","level":"required"},{"name":"3D printing","level":"required"}],"citizenship":"citizen"},"is_new":true,"first_seen":"2026-09-18T03:14:39.863539"},{"id":5341,"company_name":"EQT Corporation","title":"Midstream Operations Technician Intern","field_tags":["operations"],"sector":null,"stage":["internship"],"years":[],"term":null,"salary":null,"duration":null,"posted_at":"2026-09-16T09:01:35","location_raw":"Moundsville, WV","is_remote":false,"state":"WV","region_locations":["Moundsville, WV"],"regions":[{"loc":"Moundsville, WV","kind":"us","state":"WV"}],"ats":"greenhouse","apply_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/eqtcorporation/jobs/5424963008","description":"","status":"open","score_parts":{"field":35.0,"location":20.0,"freshness":15.0,"openness":10.0,"source":5.0},"insights":{},"is_new"